# Dragonclaw Strike: "Double the power and toughness of target creature you control until end of turn. Then it fights up to one
# target creature an opponent controls." Bot1's Grizzly Bears (2/2) is doubled to 4/4 and fights Bot2's Centaur Courser (3/3):
# the Courser dies and the Bears, which a 2/2 would not have survived, live on as a 4/4 with three damage. The hybrid cost
# {2/G}{2/U}{2/R} is paid with a green, a blue and a red mana.

